{
    "background_story": "Westyn was a charming bartender with a passion for crafting unique cocktails. His signature drink, the 'Almond Dream', featured amaretto as the main ingredient. The sweet, almond-flavored liqueur reminded him of his Italian grandmother's baking, and he loved sharing that nostalgia with his customers. As the owner of a trendy speakeasy, Westyn took pride in creating an intimate atmosphere where people could come together and savor his expertly mixed drinks. His amaretto-based creations quickly gained a loyal following, and soon, his bar became the go-to spot for special occasions and romantic nights out. Westyn's love for amaretto wasn't just about the flavor; it was about the memories and connections he made with every pour.",
